# dbt Project Rules

## Jinja Template Syntax
- NEVER add spaces inside Jinja delimiters
- Keep {{ }} not { { } }
- Keep {% %} not { % % }
- This applies to all .sql files in this project

## Formatting
- Do not auto-format .sql files that contain Jinja syntax
- Preserve {{ source() }}, {{ ref() }}, and all Jinja expressions exactly as written





